   <item>
    <widget class="QLabel" name="labelsoustitre">
     <property name="text">
      <string>Hybrid C++ &amp; Machine Learning Network Intrusion Detection System</string>
     </property>
    </widget>
   </item>
   <item>
    <widget class="QTextBrowser" name="howThisWorks">
     <property name="html">
      <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
hr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }
li.unchecked::marker { content: &quot;\2610&quot;; }
li.checked::marker { content: &quot;\2612&quot;; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Adwaita Sans'; font-size:13px; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:large; font-weight:700; color:#38bdf8;&quot;&gt;How Net-Sentry Works&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Net-Sentry analyzes network traffic in real time or from offline packet captures to detect known cyberattacks and zero-day anomalies with low latency. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#f8fafc;&quot;&gt;1. Packet Capture (Live &amp;amp; PCAP)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Captures raw packets directly from a selected network interface or replays recorded &lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'monospace';&quot;&gt;.pcap&lt;/span&gt; files for forensic analysis. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#f8fafc;&quot;&gt;2. Bidirectional Flow Extraction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Groups packets into bidirectional network flows and computes statistical telemetry features (packet rates, inter-arrival times, payload sizes, and TCP flags). &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#f8fafc;&quot;&gt;3. Hybrid ONNX Inference Engine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Evaluates every completed flow using two complementary ML stages:&lt;br /&gt;• &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Supervised Classifier (LightGBM):&lt;/span&gt; Identifies known attack signatures (DDoS, DoS, Brute Force, Port Scan, Web Attacks, Botnets).&lt;br /&gt;• &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Unsupervised Detector (Anomaly Scoring):&lt;/span&gt; Flags unknown deviations and potential zero-day behavior. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#f8fafc;&quot;&gt;4. Alerting &amp;amp; Local Persistence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Assigns a severity level to every threat, displays it immediately in the live feed, and logs it into a local database for historical review.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
     </property>
    </widget>
   </item>
  </layout>
 </widget>
